{"id":"33633dbe3ffe0aed0cc7877341a9e04832601b5e","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/MR1Osv9r2Rtr4V7F.html","title":"深拆 GPT-6.2 Astra：性能涨了、价格降了，任务成本减少近一半，OpenAI 怎么做到的？ | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"性能提升 6.2 分，Token 少 22%，API 价格降 20%。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"深拆 GPT-6.2 Astra：性能涨了、价格降了，任务成本减少近一半，OpenAI 怎么做到的？\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261123/6b03d3fb60b2f.jpg\" data-ratio=\"0.5609375\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1280\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafN80cFVXSG01KDXBY0hVwoW4ofnGics8Idl9AfSnlibGlBZrrl5yo4icROPicACBRtSsNMg7LafA6DMicxSD8UCQibGVXH2N3MREQL58/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100265891\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261123/6b03d3fb60b2f.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">性能提升 6.2 分，Token 少 22%，API 价格降 20%。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span